sions but also the exhilarating performance that comes with this unique collaboration. Through promotional campaigns, interactive events, and eco-friendly collaborations, BMW and Nike can engage their audiences in a dialogue about sustainability, innovation, and the power of coming together for a greater cause. \n\nThe BMW x Nike Eco Running Tech Jacket isn\'t just apparel; it\'s a statement of forward-thinking, conscious living, and the thrill of performance—all wrapped in a powerhouse package that embodies what both brands stand for. Join us in pioneering the future of athletic wear that marries innovation with responsibility.', 'image_url': 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dkcvg4eui/image/upload/v1748051630/product_images/BMW%20x%20Nike%20Eco%20Running%20Tech%20Jacket.png'}
