, stunning visuals, and event launches, further amplifying the impact of both brands’ commitment to a greener future. \n\nTogether, BMW and Puma can inspire change, leading the fashion industry towards a more sustainable and stylish horizon.", 'image_url': 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dkcvg4eui/image/upload/v1748196081/product_images/BMW%20x%20Puma%20Eco-Jacket.png'}
